## Table II: Statistical Significance Tests (Markdown)

| Comparison | n | Test | p-value | Significant | Cohen's d | Effect |
|:---|:---:|:---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| Tesseract → AU DIC | 500 | Wilcoxon signed-rank | 0.0431 | Yes | 0.130 | Negligible |
| Gemini Flash Lite → AU DIC | 500 | Wilcoxon signed-rank | <0.0001 | Yes | 3.237 | Large |
| GPT-4o-mini → AU DIC | 500 | Wilcoxon signed-rank | 0.0431 | Yes | 0.130 | Negligible |

_Note: The large Cohen's d (3.237) for Gemini→AU DIC reflects AU DIC's operational failure (n=5), not a true capability difference._

